				\begin{document} $$ x \sim P(f(t))  $$ \end{document}x∼P(f(t))

where f(t) is build with degree-4 spline functions. For the link function P(·), we assume that the log-transformed gene expression and motif follow Gaussian distribution: 
16\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
