				\begin{document}$\hat {\mathbf {X}}_{i}$\end{document}X^i, and the ground truth scRNA-seq data as Xi, the normalized MSE is calculated as 
20\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
