				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document} $$ \text{MSE}_{\text{norm}} = \frac{1}{N}\sum\limits_{i = 1}^{N}\left\Vert\frac{\mathbf{X}_{i}}{\Vert\mathbf{X}_{i}\Vert_{2}} - \frac{\hat{\mathbf{X}}_{i}}{\Vert\hat{\mathbf{X}}_{i}\Vert_{2}}\right\Vert_{2}^{2}  $$ \end{document}MSEnorm=1N∑i=1NXi∥Xi∥2−X^i∥X^i∥222
